OL,3,AMacron rejects minister's resignation
OL,4,Aafter weekend of riots and looting in
OL,5,AFrance
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron has
OL,8,Frejected his interior minister's
OL,9,Fresignation after a weekend of violence
OL,10,Facross France
OL,12,FMore than half a million people took to
OL,13,Fthe streets on Saturday - part of
OL,14,Fprotests that began in schools last
OL,15,Fmonth
OL,17,FBut the protests turned violent, with
OL,18,Fbuildings set on fire and shops looted
OL,20,FSome disorder continued on Sunday - in
OL,21,FParis, police arrested more than 100
OL,22,Fpeople, with five shops looted
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
