OL,4,Aafter weekend of riots and looting in
OL,5,AFrance
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Monday morning, Macron's officer
OL,8,Fannounce he had declined Interior
OL,9,FMinister Laurent Nunez's offer to step
OL,10,Fdown
